  "source_id": "aspbe-local-stored-rectangular-elimination-v1",
  "source_statement": "For arbitrary stored real N-by-M matrices, literal cached-angle persistent row updates refine the supplied exact elimination, and the legal fused adjacent sweep returns one coherent chronological log/residual satisfying action and exact length/emission; its eight annotation counters are at most count*(6M+8,1,1,2,2,10M+2N+6,6M+2N,1), with materialization callback/storage costs separate. Whole60 named declarations and anonymous instance preserved.",
